@black_brown
title: 布吕宁转向右侧寻求联盟支持。
subtitle: 眼看我们左翼坚决拒绝支持他的政府,布吕宁开始考虑与魔鬼做交易。
view-if: hitler_right_coalition >= 50 and left_strength >= 50 and political_crisis_progress >= 1 and (president == "Hindenburg" or president == "Seeckt" or (president == "Marx" and marx_relation < 40)) and chancellor == "Brüning"
on-arrival: black_brown_seen = 1; nazi_chance = nsdap_r; nazi_chance += socialism; nazi_chance += nationalism; nazi_chance -= pro_republic; nazi_chance += left_coalition if communist_coalition >= 3 and kpd_relation >= 50; nazi_chance += rb_force+rfb_force; nazi_chance -= sa_force; nazi_chance += (radicalization+capital_strike_progress+coup_progress)*political_crisis_progress;
go-to: black_brown_success if nazi_chance >= 200 and not hitler_deported; black_brown_failure if nazi_chance < 150 or (nazi_chance < 200 and not hitler_deported); black_brown_goring if hitler_deported and nazi_chance >= 150

@black_brown_success
on-arrival: chancellor = "Hitler"; chancellor_party = "NSDAP"; sa_militancy -= 0.1 if rb_force < 15; sa_strength *= 0.9 if rb_force < 15; z_relation -= 25; dvp_relation -= 25; ddp_relation -= 15

谈判漫长而紧张,希特勒拒绝让出总理之位。最终,为了阻止可能让我们社会主义者得利的又一次选举,中央党不知怎的竟同意让希特勒出任总理,以换取多数内阁席位、冲锋队的逐步解除武装,以及对天主教徒安全的保证。布吕宁勉强退让,希特勒以 [+ hitler_right_coalition +]% 的支持宣誓就任总理。

- @hitler_takes_power: 我们现在该怎么办?
- @secret_path: 我们现在该怎么办?

@secret_path
view-if: hitler_seen or presidential_powers
on-arrival: rb_militancy -= 0.1 if rb_militancy >= 0.1; reichswehr_loyalty = 0 if reichswehr_loyalty > 0
go-to: slow_consolidation if hitler_seen

[? if hitler_seen : 由于这是希特勒第二次出任总理,他谨慎得多,改为缓慢地巩固权力。 ?][? if presidential_powers : 对总统权力的限制使希特勒无法立刻巩固权力。 ?]

@slow_consolidation
on-arrival: sneaky_hitler = 1; impending_fire = 1; time_to_election = 3; z_relation += 10 if not uf_formed; nazi_peak = 0; nazi_decline = 0; labor_dissent += 10 if labor_strength < center_strength; rb_strength -= 200*(dissent); new_middle_nsdap += 4; old_middle_nsdap += 3; catholics_nsdap += 3; rural_nsdap += 4; workers_nsdap += 6; unemployed_nsdap += 10; budget -= 3; economic_growth += 1; economic_growth += 1.5 if economic_growth < 0; inflation += 2; inflation += 1.5 if inflation < 0; unemployed -= 2; unemployed -= 4 if unemployed >= 30
call: set_next_election_time

纳粹党启动了公共工程计划,并为陷入困境的企业提供补贴。与此同时,纳粹党接触德国工会总联合会,试图让工会转而反对我们。为防中央党可能背叛,希特勒解散国会,宣布新的选举定于 [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]。

国会下次开会时,希特勒肯定会有他的打算……

@black_brown_failure
on-arrival: bb_failed = 1; rural_nsdap += 3; old_middle_nsdap += 3; new_middle_nsdap += 3; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_z -= 3; unemployed_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent); workers_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent);

果不其然,谈判毫无进展。纳粹党过于顽固、毫不妥协,让市民联盟难以咽下;反过来,市民联盟要求太多、过于挑剔,纳粹党也难以接受。

- @no_majority: 于是,没有明确的多数。
- @no_majority_seeckt: 于是,没有明确的多数。
- @no_majority_marx: 于是,没有明确的多数。

@black_brown_goring
on-arrival: in_right_coalition = 1; nsdap_toleration = 1; judicial_reform -= 2; reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.1; pro_republic -= 5; sa_militancy -= 0.05; new_middle_nsdap += 3; old_middle_nsdap += 6; rural_nsdap += 6; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 6*(1-dissent); coup_progress += political_crisis_progress; coup_progress += 2; collapse_month = month+5; collapse_year = year; collapse_year += 1 if collapse_month > 12; collapse_month -= 12 if collapse_month > 12

不知怎的,纳粹党竟同意加入布吕宁政府,使该政府在国会中拥有 [+ hitler_right_coalition +]% 的支持。那道针对他们的、事实上的「防疫隔离线」由此被打破,大大有助于把他们合法化为国内一个建设性的政党 —— 尽管他们与布吕宁紧缩措施的牵连,同时也帮我们瓦解了他们在工人阶级中的支持。

民主改革随即被撤销,内阁开始把德国重新推回黑暗时代。眼下民主尚存,但纳粹党一旦有机会,定会将其彻底摧毁。

@schleicher_coalition
