@no_majority_marx
title: 没有明确的执政多数。
view-if: (not zca_formed or counterrevolution_r < 50) and (weimar_coalition < 50 or z_willing != 1) and (grand_coalition < 50 or grand_coalition_failed == 1 or dvp_willing != 1) and president = "Marx" and far_right_coalition < 50 and (right_coalition < 50 or right_coalition_failed) and (hitler_right_coalition < 50 or left_strength < 50 or political_crisis_progress < 1 or chancellor != "Brüning" or bb_failed or marx_relation >= 40) and bourgeois_coalition < 50 and not (dne_formed and chancellor == "Schleicher")
on-arrival: no_majority_elections += 1
go-to: no_majority_bracht if chancellor = "Bracht"; no_majority_scholz if chancellor = "Scholz"; no_majority_bruning2 if chancellor = "Brüning" or chancellor = "Wirth"; no_majority_spd2 if chancellor_party = "SPD" or n_elections <= 1; no_majority_nsdap if chancellor == "Hitler"; no_majority_martial_law if chancellor == "Groener"

@no_majority_martial_law
on-arrival: {!
var hitler_points = 0;
var braun_points = 0;
var bruning_points = 0;

hitler_points += Q.nsdap_r;
hitler_points += Q.nationalism;
hitler_points += Q.anti_democratic_coalition;
hitler_points += Q.socialism;
hitler_points += (100-Q.pro_republic);
hitler_points += Q.kpd_r;
hitler_points += (100-Q.marx_relation);
hitler_points += Q.rb_force+Q.rfb_force;
hitler_points -= Q.sa_force;
hitler_points += ((Q.left_strength/100)*Q.spd_r);

braun_points += Q.spd_r;
braun_points += Q.socialism;
braun_points += Q.pro_republic;
braun_points += Q.weimar_coalition;
braun_points -= Q.rb_force;
braun_points += Q.marx_relation;
braun_points -= Q.kpd_relation;
braun_points += Q.dvp_relation;

bruning_points += Q.z_r;
bruning_points += Q.neo_weimar_coalition;
bruning_points += Q.pro_republic;
bruning_points += (100-Q.socialism);
bruning_points += (100-Q.nationalism);
bruning_points -= Q.no_majority_elections;
if (braun_points >= hitler_points) {
    bruning_points += hitler_points/4;
} else {
    bruning_points += braun_points/4;
}

Q.braun_chosen = 0;
Q.hitler_chosen = 0;
Q.bruning_chosen = 0;

if (braun_points >= hitler_points && braun_points >= bruning_points) {
    Q.braun_chosen = 1;
} else if (hitler_points >= braun_points && hitler_points >= bruning_points) {
    Q.hitler_chosen = 1;
} else {
    Q.bruning_chosen = 1;
}
!}

即便在戒严之后,也没有明确的执政多数。威廉·马克思对这乱局愈发厌倦。

- @marx_hitler: 阿道夫·希特勒?
- @marx_braun: 奥托·布劳恩?
- @marx_bruning: 海因里希·布吕宁?
- @marx_wirth: 约瑟夫·维尔特?

@no_majority_bruning2
